Keep the Lights On — Ep. 1 "$1,625"

Picture
- All characters, props, backgrounds, title cards and film damage drawn in code (Canvas 2D).
- Style: "1930s Rubber Hose Cartoon" from Lemo-Opuscar (github.com/lemomo-ai/lemo-opuscar, MIT).
  toon.js and chars.js are copied unchanged from its rubber-hose demo; film.js, bg.js and mix.py are adapted from it (MIT notice applies).

Music (original composition, rendered from samples; music/score.py)
- Samples (CC0): Karoryfer Samples / sfzinstruments, VS Chamber Orchestra: Community Edition (Versilian Studios), Versilian Community Sample Library (Versilian Studios)
  Instruments used: upright bass, muted trumpet, clarinet, trombone, suspended cymbal, snare, xylophone, vibraphone, woodblock.

Sound effects
- All foley synthesised in code (mix.py, Lemo-Opuscar core/audio/sfx.py).

Fonts
- IM Fell English SC (Igino Marini), SIL Open Font License 1.1 — fonts/OFL-imfellenglishsc.txt

